  "title": "Slow Cooker Philly-Style Shredded Beef Sliders",
  "description": "These beef sliders made with slow-cooked shredded beef chuck will remind you of Philly-style cheesesteaks and are an easy dinner option.",
  "authors": [
    "Bibi"
  ],
  "date_published": "2021-01-22T03:55:53-05:00",
